<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Issue Reported - Kill The MCP</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Space Mono', 'SF Mono', monospace;
        background: #000;
        color: #00ff7f;
        padding: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 127, 0.3);
      }

      .checkmark {
        font-size: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      p {
        color: #8b9d9f;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      a {
        color: #00ff7f;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        border: 2px solid #00ff7f;
        transition: all 0.3s;
      }

      a::before {
        content: '< ';
      }

      a:hover {
        background: #00ff7f;
        color: #000;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 127, 0.5);
      }

      .note {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #22d388;
      }

      .note::before {
        content: '# ';
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
      <h1>Issue Reported</h1>
      <p>Thanks for the feedback! We'll review this and create an issue if needed.</p>
      <p>You can track progress on <a href="https://github.com/ktmcp-cli" style="display: inline; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: none;">GitHub</a>.</p>

      <a href="/">Back to Home</a>

      <p class="note">
        Issues are reviewed manually - no automated responses.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
